---
description: Next.js route handlers and server boundaries
globs: app/api/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `docs/constitutions/nextjs.md` and `docs/constitutions/zod.md` before changing route handlers.

- Keep privileged logic and secrets server-only.
- Validate external inputs with Zod.
- Prefer typed JSON responses and explicit cache headers when freshness matters.
- Do not import server-only modules into Client Components.
